OL,3,APolice accept Andrew search warrants
OL,4,Awere unlawful, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThames Valley Police has accepted that
OL,7,Fthe search warrants it used to search
OL,8,FAndrew Mountbatten-Windsor's homes
OL,9,Fearlier this year were unlawful, the
OL,10,FHigh Court has heard.
OL,12,FThe force said it accepted the "initial
OL,13,Fcourt's decision to issue warrants
OL,14,Funder the specific piece of legislation
OL,15,Fused was incorrect" when they were
OL,16,Fgiven permission to search the former
OL,17,Fprince's properties on 18 February.
OL,19,FAndrew was arrested by Thames Valley
OL,20,FPolice on suspicion of misconduct in
OL,21,Fpublic office the day after. He denies
OL,22,Fany wrongdoing.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
